OL,3,GNEWSAScience facilities protected from
OL,4,Afunding cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Oxfordshire science laboratory has
OL,7,Fsaid it will continue its research
OL,8,Fdespite a shortfall in funding.
OL,10,FRutherford Appleton Laboratory (RAL)
OL,11,Foperates from its base at the Harwell
OL,12,FScience and Innovation Campus, and is
OL,13,Ffunded by the Science and Technology
OL,14,FFacilities Council (STFC).
OL,16,FThe government has announced funding
OL,17,Fwill be moved away from the STFC over
OL,18,Fthe next four years, leaving a budget
OL,19,Fgap of #162m due to rising running
OL,20,Fcosts.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
