OL,3,GNEWSAScience facilities protected from
OL,4,Afunding cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut a spokesperson for RAL said the
OL,7,Ffacilities at Harwell had been
OL,8,Fprioritised and "remain operational",
OL,9,Fwith cuts instead being made through
OL,10,F"efficiency savings".
